\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n<ul><li>Minimum Levels available are 16, 20 and 24.</li>\n<li>Cormyrian / Cormyrean items spawn with random prefix in their name.</li>\n<li>The item description image shows one of many possible enchantment combinations.</li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817040025\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.051 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.113 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2466/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 13484/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 3740/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 10/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n191.99%  193.503     26 Template:IO\n100.00%  100.790      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  100.790      1 -total\n 97.20%   97.964      1 Template:Named_Armor\n 65.54%   66.060      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 64.76%   65.268      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 63.30%   63.805      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 62.33%   62.819      2 Template:InCategory\n 18.78%   18.927      1 Template:Mat\n 16.55%   16.680      1 Template:Popup\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:91025-0!canonical and timestamp 20260817040025 and revision id 692202. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"
